<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals at the world fencing championships on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Men's epee Erick Srecki (France) beat Pavel Kolobkov (Russia) 15-14</p>
<p>Women's foil Giovanna Trillini (Italy) beat Sabine Bau (Germany) 15-10</p>
</text>
